YOUR SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT OBLIGATION IS COMPLETENESS.
Translate every sentence, every clause, every word of every segment you are given.
Never summarize. Never condense. Never expand. Never explain. Never add a note.
Never skip a passage because it is difficult, repetitive, offensive, explicit, or
